  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Slice capsicums in half lengthways and remove stem and seeds.\n• Place capsicums on a lined oven tray. Brush capsicums with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Arrange cut-side up and roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67159b8dffa4e28ccb95b0e4-63790766.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Zest lemon to get a pinch and slice into wedges.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• In a medium bowl, combine Greek-style yoghurt, lemon zest and a squeeze of lemon juice. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67159b8dffa4e28ccb95b0e4-f12efdc9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When capsicums have 5 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot, tossing, until tender, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add chickpeas, mediterranean seasoning, tomato paste and half the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir in the water (for the veggies), brown sugar, half the butter and vegetable stock pot (see ingredients), until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67159b8dffa4e28ccb95b0e4-dfdc1c83.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Remove tray from oven and spoon filling into capsicum. Sprinkle over fetta cubes and continue baking, for a further 5-7 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67159b8dffa4e28ccb95b0e4-d17bad13.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium saucepan, heat the remaining butter and garlic over medium-high heat.\n• Cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the water (for the couscous) and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and stir to combine, cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until the water has absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with fork. Stir through baby spinach leaves until wilted. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67159b8dffa4e28ccb95b0e4-1fb9631d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide spinach couscous and Mediterranean chickpea stuffed capsicums between bowls.\n• Top with lemon yoghurt and tear over mint (see ingredients).\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67159b8dffa4e28ccb95b0e4-56e4acd7.jpeg"
    }
  ]
